| Branch prefix | Label |
|---|---|
| `feature/` | `enhancement` |
| `fix/` | `bug` |
| `docs/` | `documentation` |
| `chore/` | `chore` |
| `refactor/` | `refactor` |
| `perf/` | `performance` |
| `test/` | `test` |
| `ci/` | `ci` |
| `round/` | `round` (the parent PR) |

